    <!-- Macros -->
    <string name="ui_macros">Macros</string>
    <string name="ui_macros_intro">A macro does several things with one key: presses shortcuts, types text and waits between steps. Create one here, then open a layout, tap a key and choose Tap action → Run a macro.</string>
    <string name="ui_macros_help">Steps:\n• Shortcut: a key or combination, e.g. Ctrl + A\n• Text: typed as is\n• Pause: waits before the next step (up to 10 s), useful for slow apps\n\nUse a macro:\n• on tap: key editor → Tap action → Run a macro\n• on long press, heavy press, swipe or popup: enter macro:name\n\nMacros are stored as text (menu → Edit as text), e.g.\n\"copyAll\": (\"key:ctrl+a\", \"key:ctrl+c\")</string>
