    <string name="re_help">Syntax help</string>
    <string name="re_help_text">• ( ) groups things: the whole layout, a row, or a key. [ ] and { } work the same.\n• \"name\": \"value\" sets a parameter. : and = both work, commas are optional.\n• Values without a name are the swipe characters of a key, in this order: ↖ ↑ ↗ ← → ↙ ↓ ↘. The editor shows the arrow next to each one.\n• # starts a comment.\n• Parameters are inherited: key → row → layout → theme → settings.\n\nTips: tap a key in the preview to jump to it. The bar at the bottom shows where the cursor is and any problems; tap ⚠ to list them. Pinch to zoom. Long-press a toolbar button to see what it does.</string>

